  &lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;blockquote class=&#34;callout callout-insight&#34;&gt;
    &lt;p class=&#34;callout-title&#34;&gt;
      &lt;span class=&#34;callout-icon&#34;&gt;&lt;svg viewBox=&#34;0 0 16 16&#34; aria-hidden=&#34;true&#34;&gt;&lt;path d=&#34;M8 0 L9.6 6.4 L16 8 L9.6 9.6 L8 16 L6.4 9.6 L0 8 L6.4 6.4 Z&#34;/&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
      &lt;span class=&#34;callout-label&#34;&gt;Interesting!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;The xfrm interface has to exist &lt;em&gt;before&lt;/em&gt; strongSwan can bind the tunnel to it — which is the kind of ordering detail that costs you an afternoon.&lt;/p&gt;
  &lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;blockquote class=&#34;callout callout-tip&#34;&gt;
    &lt;p class=&#34;callout-title&#34;&gt;
